<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank reverse repo drains 3.5 bln skr.</title>
<headline>Riksbank reverse repo drains 3.5 bln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riksbank said on Tuesday it drained 3.5 billion crowns from the market in this morning's reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged fixed rate of 4.10 percent and will run from March 26 to April 2 and replaces an operation which drained five billion crowns.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 0.84 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
